    "sent_id": "t0032.s02",
    "start": 296.588,
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5104,
    "char_start": 5000,
    "end": 306.511,
    "sent_id": "t0033.s01",
    "start": 300.637,
    "text": "Honestly, the wear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5158,
    "char_start": 5105,
    "end": 309.504,
    "sent_id": "t0033.s02",
    "start": 306.511,
    "text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5228,
    "char_start": 5159,
    "end": 313.401,
    "sent_id": "t0033.s03",
    "start": 309.504,
    "text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5256,
    "char_start": 5229,
    "end": 315.046,
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01",
    "start": 313.401,
    "text": "Where does it stop working?",
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5413,
    "char_start": 5257,
    "end": 323.502,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01",
    "start": 315.046,
    "text": "And when teams adopt Shimano components within that system, the compromise becomes apparent – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5472,
    "char_start": 5414,
    "end": 326.486,
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01",
    "start": 323.502,
    "text": "What is the heuristic that you always find yourself using?",
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5542,
    "char_start": 5473,
    "end": 330.036,
    "sent_id": "t0036.s02",
    "start": 326.486,
    "text": "Where do maintenance and the mechanics of the transmission intersect?",
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5629,
    "char_start": 5543,
    "end": 335.733,
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01",
    "start": 330.036,
    "text": "Honestly, the maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5701,
    "char_start": 5630,
    "end": 340.436,
    "sent_id": "t0037.s02",
    "start": 335.733,
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5770,
    "char_start": 5702,
    "end": 345.563,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01",
    "start": 340.436,
    "text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5839,
    "char_start": 5771,
    "end": 349.6,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01",
    "start": 345.563,
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5869,
    "char_start": 5840,
    "end": 351.321,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02",
    "start": 349.6,
    "text": "Everything else is iteration.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5928,
    "char_start": 5870,
    "end": 355.189,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01",
    "start": 351.321,
    "text": "Before we close, thank you again to our friends at Linear.",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6001,
    "char_start": 5929,
    "end": 359.991,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02",
    "start": 355.189,
    "text": "Linear is the issue tracker designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6047,
    "char_start": 6002,
    "end": 362.729,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s03",
    "start": 359.991,
    "text": "Luca Moretti, thank you for the conversation.",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6066,
    "char_start": 6048,
    "end": 364.145,
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01",
